How to reproduce
----------------
Follow the Docker-based build instructions in the README of
https://github.com/maslick/koder (it builds ZBar with Emscripten and emits
zbar.wasm and zbar.js into public/wasm). Compiler versions may differ, so a
rebuild is not guaranteed to be byte-identical to the files shipped here.
Copy both emitted files (zbar.wasm and zbar.js) into this directory.

